      "lead_en": "MEPs on Wednesday called on the Czech government to ensure that the funding system for Czech Television and Czech Radio complies with EU law, guarantees sustainable and predictable funding for both public media and includes safeguards against political interference in their work. The resolution was supported by 442 of the 647 MEPs present.",
